<title>USA: MCI shareholders sue over merger deal.</title>
<headline>MCI shareholders sue over merger deal.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two lawsuits were filed by shareholders of MCI Communications Corp in the Delaware Chancery Court on Monday.</p>
<p>According to court information papers, the plaintiffs alleged MCI and its directors have breached their &quot;fiduciary duties in connection with (a) proposed corporate business transaction.&quot;</p>
<p>The lawsuits seek an injunction against the merger.</p>
<p>On Friday, MCI and British Telecommunications Plc said they were considering a merger. No other information is available about the lawsuits at this time.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
